{"id": "DKlMMS9y-Fr", "title": "Video by don.machina", "description": "FORREAL?! Damnnnnn, I guess I gotta head to London now. Real talk, I am just so grateful to be shortlisted @meta_morph_award , it feels good to be recognised for the work you do because behind the scenes, there was a lot of sleepless nights to bring this AI music video to life. You can bet that it wasn’t as easy as a prompt and voila!\n\nAs a proud Malaysian, this is also my way of saying that there is immense talent that comes from our beloved Southeast Asian country. \n\nIt’s funny how everything I am doing now started as a fun little experiment which blew up into something a lot bigger. Weirdly typical thing for me, delusionally obsessed with my hobbies that I turn it into a full blown AI cinematic studio, @visionmachina \n\nOn a much bigger note, this honestly would not be possible without the people around me that support and fuel my delusions and also keep me grounded as we build VM together. My partners @bimalmj (made this MV possible) @luke.visionmachina @kevinpinga each a rockstar in what they do.\n\nAnd of course @yungraja who so graciously gave me free rein over the concept and creative direction of your AI music video.", "channel": "don.machina", "uploader_id": "518926176", "uploader": "Don Machina", "timestamp": 1749261317, "like_count": 59, "comment_count": 7, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-567849806102921a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.745, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQO2hPijdyVUdvbdwif_q8EyOUkJl8E0pIyZI8u3glVcgDlgcf